LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell u_clocks/bad_sync[1]_i_1, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) u_clocks/bad_sync_reg[0]/PRE, u_clocks/bad_sync_reg[1]/PRE. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
